    "title": "Muzzy Donohue represents North Oaks at 3M Open on Sunday, July 26",
    "text": "Muzzy Donohue represents North Oaks at 3M Open on Sunday, July 26\nBy\nL. C. DillonA single golfer from North Oaks, Minnesota competed in the PGA Tour's 3M Open, which concluded Sunday, July 26.\nMuzzy Donohue finished tied for 34th at 273, 11-under par.\nDonohue shot rounds of 73 in the opening round, 63 in the second, 73 in the third and 64 in the final round.\nJackson Koivun won the tournament at 259, 25-under par. Scottie Scheffler finished second at 262, 22-under par, while Hideki Matsuyama tied for third at 264, 20-under par.",
    "summary": "Muzzy Donohue represents North Oaks at 3M Open on Sunday, July 26 L. C. DillonA single golfer from North Oaks, Minnesota competed in the PGA Tour's 3M Open, which concluded Sunday, July 26. Muzzy Donohue finished tied for 34th at 273, 11-under par. Donohue shot rounds of 73 in the opening round, 63 in the second, 73 in the third and 64 in the final round. Jackson Koivun won the tournament at 259, 25-under par. Scottie Scheffler finished second at 262, 22-under par, while Hideki Matsuyama tied for third at 264, 20-under par.",
